OL,3,AActress Selma Blair says she 'did not
OL,4,Aintend to harm anyone' in plane
OL,5,Aaltercation
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS actress Selma Blair has spoken out
OL,8,Fafter being accused of assaulting
OL,9,Fmultiple people on a flight to New
OL,10,FYork.
OL,12,FA publicist for the Legally Blonde star
OL,13,Fsaid she "did not intend to harm
OL,14,Fanyone" and that there was "much more
OL,15,Fto this story". Blair "experienced a
OL,16,Fmedical emergency on the flight" and is
OL,17,Fstill fighting b@Kmultiple sclerosis
OL,18,F(MS), a statement read.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
